SUMMARY:It's All About MARY'S, Naturally!
LOCATION:MATCH - Midtown Arts & Theater Cen
 ter Houston
URL:https://www.facebook.com/events/1748292576070873/
DESCRIPTION:Just what you've been waiting for!
   Heart of Leather Foundation pres
 ents Out of the Archives II\, It's 
 All About Mary's\, Naturally!  Four
  days of viewing the most coveted 
 treasure of Houston's LGBTQIA+ Gay
 /Queer community\, Mary's bar tops\,
  with other representations of wha
 t Mary's meant to our community.  
 This will also be a chance to reco
 nnect with old friends and "buddie
 s" you haven't seen in many years.
   \nWednesday\, September 9 the gall
 ery will open at 3PM.  Soft drinks
  will be available from 3 - 6\, but
  the gallery will be open till 9PM
 .\nThursday\, September 10 the galle
 ry will be open again from 3PM til
 l 9PM.\nFriday\, September 11 the ga
 llery will be open from Noon to 9P
 M.\nSaturday\, September 12 from 10A
 M to Noon there will be an open mi
 c time for people to share their f
 avorite stories from time spent at
  Mary's.  You might be surprised t
 o see who shows up. It might be so
 meone you lost contact with 20 yea
 rs ago.  It could even be that Mr.
  Right Now who left his socks at y
 our place after that one steamy ni
 ght.\nThe gallery will stay open ti
 ll 9PM\, with a toast to close the 
 exhibit and honor the memories mad
 e at "The National Bar of Texas".\n
 Donations will be accepted at the 
 door since we are working toward t
 he goal of being able to open a mu
 seum to exhibit and teach the hist
 ory of this vibrant community.  \nP
 lease go to heartofleather.org to 
 see sponsorship opportunities.\n\nht
 tps://www.facebook.com/events/1748
 292576070873/
CLASS:PUBLIC
STATUS:CONFIRMED
PARTSTAT:TENTATIVE
END:VEVENT
